"Perpetual futures.",strong:!0}," Trade perpetual futures on Hyperliquid from your own wallet, through BOI's trading interface."],[{text:"Points and badges.",strong:!0}," Earn points and badges for taking part. They have no cash value."])),c("Supported networks",i("BNB Chain, Base, Arbitrum, Avalanche, Robinhood Chain, HyperEVM and Arc, plus Hyperliquid for trading.")),c("How BOI works with your money",i("BOI is software. We do not hold user funds, act as a counterparty, or give financial advice. Every transaction is started and approved by you and executed by the relevant blockchain or third-party protocol. Fees charged by BOI are shown before you confirm. Read our ",{text:"Terms of Service",href:"/terms"},", ",{text:"Privacy Policy",href:"/privacy"}," and ",{text:"Risk Disclosure",href:"/risk"}," before you use BOI.")),c("Who runs BOI",i("BOI is operated by BoiTheBear LLC, a limited liability company registered in Delaware, United States, with its registered office at 8 The Green, Suite B, Dover, Delaware 19901.")),c("Contact",i("Email ",{text:"info@boithebear.com",href:"mailto:info@boithebear.com"}," or follow ",{text:"@boithebear",href:"https://x.com/boithebear"}," on X. We will never ask for your keys, recovery codes or sign-in details."))]},terms:{title:"Terms of Service",meta:[{label:"Last Updated",value:"October 8, 2026"}],intro:[i('These Terms of Service (the "Terms") are a binding agreement between you and BoiTheBear LLC, a Delaware limited liability company ("BOI", "we", "us" or "our"), and govern your access to and use of www.boithebear.com, our web app, and every related feature, content and service we provide (together, the "Services").'),i("By accessing or using the Services, or by signing in, you agree to these Terms and acknowledge that you have read our ",{text:"Privacy Policy",href:"/privacy"}," and our ",{text:"Risk Disclosure",href:"/risk"},". The Risk Disclosure forms part of these Terms. If you do not agree, do not use the Services."),i({text:"Please read Section 22 carefully. It requires disputes to be resolved by individual binding arbitration and waives class actions and jury trials, unless you opt out as described there.",strong:!0})],sections:[c("1. Who may use BOI",i("To use the Services you must:"),s("be at least 18 years old and able to form a binding contract;","not be barred from using the Services under any law that applies to you;","not be a person or entity named on, or owned or controlled by anyone named on, any sanctions list maintained by the United States (including the OFAC Specially Designated Nationals list), the United Nations, the European Union or the United Kingdom;","not be located in, organized in or ordinarily resident in any country or region subject to comprehensive sanctions, including Cuba, Iran, North Korea, Syria and the Crimea, Donetsk and Luhansk regions of Ukraine;","not use the Services on behalf of anyone who does not meet these requirements."),i("Some features are not available in every country. We may restrict, limit or block any feature, in any location or for any person, at any time and for any reason, including to comply with law or with the requirements of our service providers.")),c("2. Changes to these Terms",i('We may change these Terms at any time. We will post the updated Terms on this page and update the "Last Updated" date. If a change is material, we will make reasonable efforts to give notice, for example in the app. Your continued use of the Services after the change takes effect means you accept the updated Terms.')),c("3. What BOI is, and what it is not",i("BOI is a social platform for the crypto community. It lets you create a profile, post and interact with others, message and join communities, support creators, and use a self-custodial wallet interface to interact with public blockchains and with third-party protocols."),i("BOI provides software and an interface only. BOI is ",{text:"not",strong:!0}," a bank, broker, dealer, exchange, custodian, money transmitter, payment processor, investment adviser, commodity trading adviser or fiduciary. We do not hold your assets, do not execute or settle trades on your behalf, do not act as a counterparty to your transactions and do not give advice. Every transaction you make is initiated and approved by you and executed by the relevant blockchain or third-party protocol.")),c("4. Your account and sign-in",i("You sign in through a supported third-party method, such as your X account or, where offered, your Google account. You are responsible for keeping your sign-in methods, devices, recovery details, app lock and any two-factor authentication secure, and for all activity under your account. Tell us promptly at ",{text:"info@boithebear.com",href:"mailto:info@boithebear.com"}," if you believe your account has been compromised."),i("You must give accurate information and must not impersonate anyone, create accounts to evade a restriction or ban, or create multiple accounts to abuse any program. We may refuse, suspend or close any account.")),c("5. Your wallet",i("When you sign in, a wallet is made available to you through third-party wallet infrastructure (currently Web3Auth). The wallet is self-custodial:"),s("BOI does not hold your assets and does not store or receive your private key.","You can export your private key from the wallet screen. Anyone who has it controls your wallet, so keep it secret and never share it.","You are solely responsible for your wallet, the assets in it and every transaction you approve.","Access to your wallet depends on your sign-in method and on the third-party wallet infrastructure. If you lose access to your sign-in account, or if that infrastructure fails or changes, you may lose access to your wallet and its assets. BOI cannot restore lost access or recover lost assets.","BOI cannot reverse, cancel or refund any blockchain transaction.","Balances, prices and values shown in the Services come from blockchains and third-party data sources and may be delayed or inaccurate.")),c("6. Creator tickets",i("Creator tickets are digital access passes created by smart contracts. Their price is set automatically by a price curve and changes as tickets are bought and sold. A protocol fee, a creator fee set by the creator and, where applicable, a referral fee are applied to each purchase and sale and are shown before you confirm."),i("A ticket is a digital item that may unlock access to a creator's rooms or features chosen by that creator. A ticket does not give you any ownership, equity, debt, revenue, profit, voting or other right in BOI or in any creator, and is not a promise of any return. Creators are independent users, not our employees or agents, and they may change, reduce or end what they offer at any time. BOI is not responsible for what creators do or do not provide.")),c("7. Tips",i("Tips are voluntary transfers of digital assets from your wallet to another user. Tips are final and cannot be refunded or reversed. A fee may apply and is shown before you confirm.")),c("8. Swaps, bridges and third-party routing",i("Token swaps and bridges are routed through independent third-party aggregators, protocols and liquidity sources. Quotes are estimates and can change before your transaction is confirmed. You may receive less than quoted because of slippage, price impact or fees. A fee may apply and is shown before you confirm. The appearance of a token in the Services is not a review, listing decision or endorsement by BOI.")),c("9. Perpetual futures",i("The Services may give you an interface to trade perpetual futures on Hyperliquid, an independent third-party venue. Orders are signed in your own wallet and executed by Hyperliquid, not by BOI. BOI is not your counterparty and does not hold your margin. Your use of Hyperliquid is subject to Hyperliquid's own terms, and you must meet its eligibility requirements. BOI may receive a builder fee from your trades, and this fee is shown or disclosed before you trade. Perpetual futures involve leverage and the risk of liquidation and total loss, as described in our ",{text:"Risk Disclosure",href:"/risk"},"."),i({text:"Automated trading tools.",strong:!0}," We may offer, on a limited or experimental basis, tools such as copy trading or grid trading. If you enable one, you approve an agent on Hyperliquid that our systems use to place orders for your account within the settings you choose, until you revoke it on Hyperliquid or turn the tool off. These tools can fail, be delayed, stop, or execute at prices you would not choose, and a leader's past results say nothing about future results. You remain solely responsible for every order placed for your account and for monitoring your positions. We may limit, pause or end any tool at any time.")),c("10. Card purchases",i("Where offered, you may buy digital assets with a card or other payment method through an independent third-party provider such as MoonPay. The provider sells the asset to you directly under its own terms and privacy policy, performs its own identity checks, decides whether to approve your purchase and sets its own fees and rates. The purchased asset is delivered to your wallet. Nothing else is bought automatically after a card purchase. Card purchases are not available in every country, including Turkey. If BOI charges its own fee on a card purchase, it will be shown to you before you pay.")),c("11. Fees and taxes",i("Fees charged by BOI are shown before you confirm the relevant action. Blockchain network fees and third-party fees are separate and are paid by you, including when a transaction fails. We may change our fees at any time; a change applies only to actions you take after it. You are responsible for determining, reporting and paying any taxes that apply to your activity.")),c("12. Points, badges, rewards and promotions",i("We may offer points, badges, ranks, referral rewards and similar programs. Unless we expressly say otherwise in writing, they have no cash or monetary value, are not your property, cannot be sold, can be transferred only through features we provide, and may be changed, reset, suspended or ended at any time without liability. We may withhold or remove them if we believe a program has been abused, for example through multiple accounts, automation, wash activity or self-referral. Taking part does not create any right to receive tokens, money or other assets."),i("Token distributions, airdrops, registrations, competitions and other promotions are offered at our sole discretion and are subject to their published rules and eligibility requirements. We may change, delay or cancel them, and they create no right to anything until it is actually delivered. We may exclude anyone from a promotion to prevent abuse or to comply with law.")),c("13. Your content",i("You own the content you post. By posting content on the Services, you grant BOI a worldwide, non-exclusive, royalty-free, sublicensable and transferable license to host, store, reproduce, display, distribute, adapt and promote that content in connection with operating, improving and promoting the Services. Public content can be seen, shared and quoted by others, and on-chain activity is permanently public."),i("You are responsible for your content and confirm you have the rights needed to post it. We do not endorse user content and are not responsible for it. Direct messages are not end-to-end encrypted and are stored on our service providers' servers; do not send information you need to keep secret. Audio and video in Spaces, live streams and calls are transmitted in real time, and other participants may record them.")),c("14. Rules of conduct",i("You must not use the Services to:"),s("break any law or regulation, or help anyone else do so;","commit or promote fraud, scams, phishing or the theft of assets or accounts;","manipulate markets, including pump and dump schemes, wash trading, spoofing or coordinated misleading promotion;","evade sanctions 