 It does not list every risk. Read it carefully, and do not use BOI if you do not understand these risks or cannot afford to lose the assets you use.")],sections:[c("1. You can lose all of your assets",i("Digital assets are highly volatile. Their prices can fall sharply, quickly and permanently, including to zero. Past performance says nothing about future results. Only use assets you can afford to lose completely.")),c("2. No advice and no guarantees",i("Nothing on BOI is financial, investment, legal or tax advice, a recommendation, or an offer or solicitation to buy or sell anything. Posts, rankings, leaderboards, trending lists, price charts, creator content and any other information on BOI are not endorsements. BOI does not guarantee any return, price, liquidity, outcome or result. You alone decide what to do and you are responsible for your decisions.")),c("3. Blockchain transactions are final",i("Transactions on public blockchains cannot be reversed, cancelled or refunded by BOI. If you send assets to the wrong address, on the wrong network, or approve a transaction you did not intend, the assets may be lost permanently. Network fees are paid even when a transaction fails.")),c("4. Wallet and access risk",i("Your BOI wallet is self-custodial: BOI does not hold your assets and does not store your private key. Access to your wallet depends on your sign-in method and on third-party key infrastructure. If you lose access to the account you sign in with, or if that infrastructure fails or changes, you may lose access to your wallet and the assets in it. Never share your sign-in details, recovery codes or keys with anyone. BOI staff will never ask for them.")),c("5. Smart contract and protocol risk",i("Creator tickets, tips, swaps, bridges, perpetual trading, automated trading tools and other features rely on smart contracts, third-party protocols and software that can fail. These may contain bugs or vulnerabilities, may be exploited, paused, upgraded or changed, and may behave in unexpected ways. Audits, where they exist, do not remove these risks.")),c("6. Third-party services",i("Some features are provided by independent third parties, for example wallet infrastructure, swap and bridge aggregators, perpetual trading venues such as Hyperliquid, card payment providers, blockchain networks and data providers. BOI does not control them and is not responsible for their availability, pricing, errors, losses, security or decisions, including decisions to block, freeze or reverse activity. Their own terms apply to your use of them.")),c("7. Leverage and perpetual futures",i("Perpetual futures are complex, leveraged products. Small price moves can cause large losses, and your position can be liquidated automatically, losing some or all of your margin. Funding payments, fees, price gaps, low liquidity, oracle errors, venue outages and auto-deleveraging can increase losses. Markets that track stocks, commodities or other assets may trade when the underlying market is closed and may differ from it. BOI is not your counterparty and does not execute, clear or guarantee these trades.")),c("8. Creator tickets",i("Creator tickets are digital access passes whose price is set automatically by a smart contract curve. The price can fall, there may be few or no buyers when you want to sell, and fees apply to purchases and sales. A ticket gives no ownership, equity, debt, revenue, profit, voting or other rights in BOI or in any creator, and no right to any particular content, service or benefit. Creators may change, reduce or stop what they offer to ticket holders at any time.")),c("9. Tokens, new tokens and memecoins",i("Many tokens, especially newly created tokens and memecoins, have little or no liquidity, no underlying value and no reliable information. They can be designed or controlled by people who intend to harm buyers, including by selling large holdings suddenly, changing token rules or abandoning the project. The appearance of a token on BOI, on a chart or in search is not a review or endorsement. Do your own research.")),c("10. Swaps, bridges and price movement",i("Quotes can change between the time you see them and the time your transaction is confirmed. Slippage, price impact, failed routes, bridge delays and bridge failures can result in receiving less than expected or in assets being delayed or lost. Stablecoins can lose their peg.")),c("11. Card purchases",i("Where card purchases are offered, they are provided by a third-party provider under its own terms, identity checks and limits. The provider decides whether to approve a purchase, sets its own fees and exchange rate, and may delay or decline transactions. Card purchases are not available in every country, including Turkey. A card purchase only delivers the purchased asset to your wallet; nothing else is bought automatically.")),c("12. Points, badges and rewards",i("Points, badges, ranks, rewards and similar programs on BOI have no cash or monetary value, are not property, cannot be sold, can be transferred only through features we provide, and may be changed, reset or ended at any time. Taking part does not create any right to receive tokens, money or other assets.")),c("13. Network and service availability",i("Blockchains can be congested, forked, halted or attacked. BOI and the services it relies on can be slow, unavailable or show inaccurate data, including balances and prices. You may be unable to act at the time you want to.")),c("14. Regulatory and tax risk",i("Laws and regulations for digital assets differ by country and can change at any time. A change may restrict or end your ability to use some or all features. You are responsible for knowing and following the laws that apply to you and for reporting and paying any taxes on your activity.")),c("15. Scams and impersonation",i("Scammers may impersonate BOI, its staff or creators, or create fake websites, tokens and links. Only trust links on www.boithebear.com and our official X account ",{text:"@boithebear",href:"https://x.com/boithebear"},". Check every transaction before you approve it."))]},contact:{title:"Contact",meta:[{label:"Legal Entity",value:"BoiTheBear LLC"},{label:"Official Website",value:"www.boithebear.com"}],intro:[i("BOI is operated by BoiTheBear LLC, a Delaware limited liability company.")],sections:[c("General inquiries and support",i("Email us at ",{text:"info@boithebear.com",href:"mailto:info@boithebear.com"},".")),c("Registered office",i("8 The Green, Suite B, Dover, Delaware 19901, United States.")),c("Legal notices, privacy requests and copyright notices",i("Send them to ",{text:"info@boithebear.com",href:"mailto:info@boithebear.com"},' with the subject "Legal notice", "Privacy request" or "Copyright notice".')),c("Official channels",i("Only these channels speak for BOI. We will never ask for your keys, recovery codes or sign-in details."),s(["Website: ",{text:"www.boithebear.com",href:"/"}],["X: ",{text:"@boithebear",href:"https://x.com/boithebear"}]))]}},l=[{key:"about",path:"/about",label:"About",description:"What BOI is and how to reach BoiTheBear LLC, the company that operates it."},{key:"terms",path:"/terms",label:"Terms",description:"The Terms of Service for BOI, operated by BoiTheBear LLC."},{key:"privacy",path:"/privacy",label:"Privacy",description:"The Privacy Policy for BOI, operated by BoiTheBear LLC."},{key:"risk",path:"/risk",label:"Risk",description:"The Risk Disclosure for BOI, operated by BoiTheBear LLC."}]}}]);